 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "规则被组合利用，不只发生在借贷里。",
   "spoken": "规则被组合利用，不只发生在借贷里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "治理攻击，是攻击者拿到足够的投票权，通过恶意提案，合法地转走协议资产。",
   "spoken": "治理攻击，是攻击者拿到足够的投票权，通过恶意提案，合法的转走协议资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.42,
   "dur": 7.008,
   "speechStart": 5.518,
   "speechEnd": 11.589
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "2022 年 4 月，以太坊上的 Beanstalk。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 4 月，以太坊上的 Beanstalk。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.648,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 12.746,
   "speechEnd": 15.722
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "它的投票权，按当前的存款计算。",
   "spoken": "它的投票权，按当前的存款计算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.78,
   "dur": 3.528,
   "speechStart": 16.878,
   "speechEnd": 19.461
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "它另有一条紧急通道。",
   "spoken": "它另有一条紧急通道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.528,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 20.626,
   "speechEnd": 22.09
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "按 CertiK 的分析，提案满 1 天，拿到三分之二的票，就能立刻执行。",
   "spoken": "按 CertiK 的分析，提案满 1 天，拿到三分之二的票，就能立刻执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.148,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 23.246,
   "speechEnd": 28.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.44,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 29.538,
   "speechEnd": 30.692
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "闪电贷必须在同一笔交易里归还。用借来的代币，能通过提案吗？",
   "spoken": "闪电贷必须在同一笔交易里归环。用借来的代币，能通过提案吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 31.748,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 31.846,
   "speechEnd": 37.581
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "能。借款，存入，投票，执行，还款，全在同一笔交易里。",
   "spoken": "能。借款，存入，投票，执行，环款，全在同一笔交易里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 38.92,
   "dur": 7.248,
   "speechStart": 39.018,
   "speechEnd": 45.337
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "闪电贷的归还限制，一步也没有挡住。",
   "spoken": "闪电贷的归环限制，一步也没有挡住。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 46.388,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 46.486,
   "speechEnd": 49.628
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "攻击者提前一天，就提交了提案。",
   "spoken": "攻击者提前一天，就提交了提案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.688,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 50.786,
   "speechEnd": 53.274
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "获利口径各方不同。CertiK 称约 7600 万美元，Beanstalk 称约 7700 万美元，PeckShield 估约 8000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "获利口径各方不同。CertiK 称约 7600 万美元，Beanstalk 称约 7700 万美元，PeckShield 估约 8000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 54.34,
   "dur": 9.936,
   "speechStart": 54.438,
   "speechEnd": 63.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "修复有两步。",
   "spoken": "修复有两步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 64.496,
   "dur": 2.064,
   "speechStart": 64.594,
   "speechEnd": 65.725
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "投票权用提案创建之前那个区块的快照。借来的代币，那时并不在你手里。",
   "spoken": "投票权用提案创建之前那个区块的快照。借来的代币，那时并不在你手里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 66.78,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 66.878,
   "speechEnd": 72.828
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "提案通过以后，先过时间锁，再执行。中间留出守护者否决的机会。",
   "spoken": "提案通过以后，先过时间锁，再执行。中间留出守护者否决的机会。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 73.888,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 73.986,
   "speechEnd": 79.567
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "再加上法定人数，并锁定提案内容。内容一改，重新计时。",
   "spoken": "再加上法定人数，并锁定提案内容。内容一改，虫新计时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 80.636,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 80.734,
   "speechEnd": 86.017
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "奖励分发，也有同样的问题。",
   "spoken": "奖励分发，也有同样的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 87.072,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speechStart": 87.17,
   "speechEnd": 89.479
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "如果奖励按存入那一刻的余额计算，就能用闪电贷存入，领奖，取出。",
   "spoken": "如果奖励按存入那一刻的余额计算，就能用闪电贷存入，领奖，取出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 90.532,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 90.63,
   "speechEnd": 95.927
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "修复是让奖励随时间累积，存入以后有最短锁定期。",
   "spoken": "修复是让奖励随时间垒积，存入以后有最短锁定期。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 96.968,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 97.066,
   "speechEnd": 101.304
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "奖励的计算，不能读一笔交易里就能改变的数据，比如本区块的成交量，或者池子的价格。",
   "spoken": "奖励的计算，不能读一笔交易里就能改变的数据，比如本区块的成交量，或者池子的价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 102.372,
   "dur": 7.608,
   "speechStart": 102.47,
   "speechEnd": 109.136
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "这几件事有个共同点。攻击者借来的，是规模。利用的，是时间。",
   "spoken": "这几件事有个共同点。攻击者借来的，是规模。利用的，是时间。",
